    "## 3. Model\n",
    "\n",
    "All arms start from frozen **DINOv2 ViT-B/14** with Baseline 2 crop and disease Linear Heads. Additive pair scores sum crop and disease log-probabilities. A1–A3 carry over the Matched Selection objectives and transforms. F0–F2 branch from A2 so blur stays isolated in A3.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Arm | Change |\n",
    "| --- | --- |\n",
    "| A1 | Crop/disease logit decorrelation |\n",
    "| A2 | A1 + Cross-crop SupCon on disease logits |\n",
    "| A3 | A2 + occasional Gaussian blur |\n",
    "| F0 | A2 + Cross-crop Batch Sampler |\n",
    "| F1 | F0 + projected crop/disease branches, learned pair fusion and pair cross-entropy |\n",
    "| F2 | F1 + same-disease, different-crop feature recombination |\n",
    "\n",
    "The sampler visits every fit image once per epoch and groups eligible cross-crop positives. Fusion adds a cosine compatibility between joint image features and a factorized pair embedding built from learned crop and disease embeddings. Recombination keeps the anchor's crop evidence and uses the disease evidence of a same-disease image from another crop. The mixed view shares the anchor's existing fit-pair target. Eligible anchors give half of their pair-loss weight to the mixed view."
   ],
