    "## 4. Training\n",
    "\n",
    "Train all six arms on the same train-derived fit split. Compare them by **raw tune Top-1 harmonic mean**, breaking ties with proxy Top-1, seen Top-1, then the earlier epoch. Tune each recipe's seen penalty on its chosen development epoch. Report the disjoint check with both scoring rules.\n",
    "\n",
    "`raw_ablation_deltas.csv` compares each arm with its preceding control on both tune and check. Historical B0 scores should be compared separately and labeled with their original run because this notebook does not retrain B0."
   ],
